    "description": "This short loop walk follows the Tubbercurry Forest Trail in the town of Tubbercurry in County Sligo. The pleasant surfaced trail can be found on the western side of the town. On the route you will see painted rocks, bug hotels and fairy habitats. There's also peaceful woodland, views of the surrounding countryside and views of the River Maiden to enjoy. To continue your walking in the area you could head west to visit Lough Talt .",
